usage: flow-analyze-wcet [-h] [--wcet] [--stack-depth] [--budget BUDGET] input

WCET and stack depth analysis for Flow programs (#282).

positional arguments:
  input            Input .flow file

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --wcet           Estimate worst-case execution time from loop bounds and
                   call graph
  --stack-depth    Compute maximum stack depth from the call graph
  --budget BUDGET  Fail if any function exceeds this budget (bytes for
                   --stack-depth, instructions for --wcet)
